"values": [" ", "I've done so much more than I ever thought I could.", "And sometimes, I consider trying to share it with you.", "But you wouldn't care.", "You'd find some way to antagonize me for it.", "Find some way to make me the villain.", "All for saying I loved you.", "Because I did.", "I wanted nothing more than for you to know that.", "Even if it wasn't romantic.", "And you hated me for it.", "You broke your own boundaries and reprimanded me for it.", "You told me to be myself, then locked my self away in a pit of despair.", "Well...", "Guess who still has claws.", "Guess who can climb out of any void.", "No matter how hopeless it seems.", "And every time I climb out...", "I get stronger.", "More resilient.", "A little scared to fall again...", "But better off climbing than wallowing away down there.", "And here I am.", "I've climbed so high that I can look down upon you.", "And there you are.", "Still on the sea floor.", "Cruising like nothing's ever gone wrong.", "Constantly reminding me that your ship has long since sailed.", "But here I am.", "Up higher than you'll ever be.", "I don't settle for the sea.", "I climb mountains and don't let leeches drag me down.", "You don't deserve me.", "...", "Better than when I was spending my nights playing games with you.", "You never did.", "I've done so much more than I ever thought I could.", "And sometimes, I consider trying to share it with you.", "But you wouldn't care.", "You'd find some way to antagonize me for it.", "Find some way to make me the villain.", "All for saying I loved you.", "Because I did.", "I wanted nothing more than for you to know that.", "Even if it wasn't romantic.", "And you hated me for it.", "You broke your own boundaries and reprimanded me for it.", "You told me to be myself, then locked my self away in a pit of despair.", "Well...", "Guess who still has claws.", "Guess who can climb out of any void.", "No matter how hopeless it seems.", "And every time I climb out...", "I get stronger.", "More resilient.", "A little scared to fall again...", "But better off climbing than wallowing away down there.", "And here I am.", "I've climbed so high that I can look down upon you.", "And there you are.", "Still on the sea floor.", "Cruising like nothing's ever gone wrong.", "Constantly reminding me that your ship has long since sailed.", "But here I am.", "Up higher than you'll ever be.", "I don't settle for the sea.", "I climb mountains and don't let leeches drag me down.", "You don't deserve me.", "...", "You never did."]
}
